   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "text": "Simple queue model: average wait ≈ ρ/(1−ρ) service times, where ρ = utilisation. Run CPUs at ~60–70% for latency-sensitive services.",
